of fact, the relation
\[ (AxB)_{F\boxtimes G} \hand{\simeq} A_{/F}\ x\ B_{/G}\ \hand{,} \]
already noticed before\hand{,} implies that this interpretation holds, indepen-%
dently of strictness. In the classical statement of Eilenberg-Zilber
